{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-18","kind":"proposition","title":"直线切圆从圆心作直线至切界必为切线之垂线","englishTitle":"If a straight line touch a circle, and a straight line be joined from the centre to the point of contact, the straight line so joined will be perpendicular to the tangent.","book":3,"number":18,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.18","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.18/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":18,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","contentId":"euclid-3-18","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e2c35b9cb77374cb26f4cad12db3fdbbbcf0d05fbc48b1f19d7d214ccc64204","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-18.statement","euclid-3-18.construction.1","euclid-3-18.proof.1","euclid-3-18.proof.2","euclid-3-18.proof.3","euclid-3-18.proof.4","euclid-3-18.proof.5","euclid-3-18.conclusion","euclid-3-18.historical.1","euclid-3-18.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-18.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8c9ee5bf26a7cb0eb93a1683d3ebc065715e2701f89929b56037250ab0db6f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line touch a circle, and a straight line be joined from the centre to the point of contact, the straight line so joined will be perpendicular to the tangent."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线触碰一个圆,而一条直线从中心连接到接触点,那么,如此连接的直线将与正切线垂直。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"直线切圜从圜心作直线至切界必为切线之垂线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从圆心到切线端的圆的切线必须垂直于切线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-18.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8874b450f97d3f4b0f796c580b9f871b1315ab6fa5f206f7c2eb2f6e7c3ce3c5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a straight line DE touch the circle ABC at the point C, let the centre F of the circle ABC be taken, and let FC be joined from F to C; I say that FC is perpendicular to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线DE触摸C点的ABC圆,让ABC圆的中心F接住,让FC连接F至C;我说FC直线直线直线切到DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-18.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d69bb8c0cbe34d2380f1d2cdd8e25f4b41a370674e36d3dd821e24c368d915e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, let FG be drawn from F perpendicular to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果不是,则从F直角至DE直角划出FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-18.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f16bf8984f85fe846075adb62f1fee446af153af6e4a3d36e4dc621d44d909e","citations":["euclid-1-17","euclid-1-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the angle FGC is right, the angle FCG is acute; [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)] and the greater angle is subtended by the greater side; [[I. 19](/principles/euclid-1-19)] therefore FC is greater than FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FGC该角是直角,FCG角度是急性的;较大的数量角度被较大的数量角度所分解;因此,FC角度大于FG。 [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)] [[I. 19](/principles/euclid-1-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-18.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1db38a8f830f74e5273a95d80e78ce081b084ba782736bdc2a4af144ce7da57","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FC is equal to FB; therefore FB is also greater than FG, the less than the greater: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FC等于FB;因此,FB也大于FG, 数量小于更大的数量:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-18.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"680ff7b624500fbb7146a8841b3f2a57d1d772577ca047d3f09dab7571de7f51","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FG is not perpendicular to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG项并不与DE项直接相关。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-18.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a02edb43f9043d96029c7929876659e101adbabf6a404bb5bbd8f5337459d3e2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is any other straight line except FC; therefore FC is perpendicular to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,除FC外,没有其他直线;因此,FC直线与DE直线是垂直的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-18.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-18.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ddae0c1fa91afb90efde90079bc8472ce8c180f606672cbbee068945e48bb5e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"直线切圜从圜心作直线至切界必为切线之垂线解曰甲乙直线切丙丁圜于丙从戊心至切界作戊丙线题言戊丙为甲乙之垂线论曰如云不然令从戊别作垂线如至已而截丙丁圜于丁其丙戊己角形之戊己丙既为直角即宜大于己丙戊角〈一卷十七〉而对大角之戊丙边宜大于对小角之戊己边矣〈一卷十九〉夫戊丙与戊丁等也戊丙大于戊已则戊丁亦大于戊己乎又论曰若云丙非直角即其两旁角一锐一钝令乙丙戊为锐角则锐角乃大于半圜分角乎〈本篇十六〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线关于圆的切线必须从圆心垂直于切线边界，解释如下：甲乙 切于直线，丙丁 切于圆丙，从戊的圆心作直线至切线边界戊丙。命题解释：戊丙 垂直于甲乙。证明如下：若不然，从戊作一条独立的垂线，如果丙丁在丁被截断，则三角形戊己丙的丙戊己为直角，所以应大于己丙戊 和 〈一卷十七〉。对于戊，戊丙的边应大于小角的戊己的边。〈一卷十九〉和戊丙等于戊丁。如果戊丙大于戊，则戊丁也大于戊己。如果丙不是直角，但其边角一个锐角一个钝角，则乙丙戊为锐角，然后锐角大于半圆弧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-18.source","contentId":"euclid-3-18","revisionId":"euclid-3-18@raw-0e2c35b9cb77374c","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"feda15620b09463576170ada15b504cbd6de9f593eac7f0971e2d35a8bbb74fa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.18/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.18\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-18:euclid-1-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-18.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"I. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-18:euclid-1-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-18.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"I. 19"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-19:euclid-3-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-19.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.19/","sourceLabel":"III. 18"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-36:euclid-3-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-36","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-36.proof.2","euclid-3-